      },
      "series_id": null,
      "season_number": null,
      "description": "<p>Harjai Piya is an emotional Urdu novel written by Abiha Malik. It captures a deep story of family values, sacrifices, and unconditional love. The book highlights how unexpected tragedies test human bonds and how true feelings eventually heal everything.</p><h2><b>Main Characters:</b></h2><ul><li><p><b>Aiman Ali:</b> The central female lead who faces the pain of becoming a widow and later adapts to a forced second marriage.</p></li><li><p><b>Captain Ahmer Ali Khan:</b> Aiman's first husband and a brave army officer who achieves martyrdom in Waziristan.</p></li><li><p><b>Ashshar Ali Khan:</b> Ahmer’s younger brother who marries Aiman due to family pressure but carries a hidden love for her.</p></li><li><p><b>Dabeer:</b> The son of Aiman and Ahmer, born on his father's martyrdom day, raised completely by Ashshar.</p></li><li><p><b>Rafeeya:</b> Aiman's emotional best friend and Ashshar’s ex-fiancée.</p></li><li><p><b>Dua Lashari:</b> The antagonist who attempts to break Ashshar’s marriage through fake pictures and planning.</p></li></ul><h2><b>Plot Summary</b></h2><p>\r\nThe story starts with the happy marriage of Aiman and Captain Ahmer. Their joy is short-lived as Ahmer gets martyred during a military operation in Waziristan. On the same day, Aiman gives birth to their son, Dabeer.</p><p><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></p><p>After her Iddat, Ashshar’s sick mother forces Ashshar and Aiman to marry to protect the family. Ashshar breaks his engagement with Rafeeya for his mother's sake. For a long time, Aiman keeps an emotional distance due to her past grief. Later, an obsessed woman named Dua Lashari plots a misunderstanding between them using fake photos. However, Ashshar handles the situation smartly, exposes Dua, and confesses his childhood love for Aiman. The novel concludes beautifully with a happy family and the birth of their daughter seven years later.</p>",
      "image": "images/115-6a5f0ad459c9b-harjai-piya-novel-by-abiha-malik-complete-pdf.webp",
      "read_online_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NT4ADa5Veo4LNwbY5vMbpLDgWvMDxloN/view",
