      },
      "series_id": null,
      "season_number": null,
      "description": "<p><b>Baab-e-Dehar</b> (The Gate of Time) is an intense political thriller and romantic novel written by <b>Mehrulnisa Shahmeer</b>. The story explores themes of revenge, betrayal, political corruption, and true friendship.</p><h3><b>Novel Details</b></h3><p><!--EndFragment--><!--EndFragment--></p><ul><li><strong><span>Novel Name:</span></strong><span> Baab-e-Dehar</span></li><li><strong><span>Writer:</span></strong><span> Mehrulnisa Shahmeer</span></li><li><strong><span>Language:</span></strong><span> Urdu</span></li><li><strong><span>Format:</span></strong><span> Online Read &amp; PDF Download</span></li><li><strong><span>Genre:</span></strong><span> Romance, Suspense, Kidnapping, Revenge, Village, Friendship</span></li></ul><h3><b>Main Characters at a Glance</b></h3><p><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></p><ul><li><p><b>Zalatan Safdar:</b> A sharp politician who secretly loves Zukhruf.</p></li><li><p><b>Zukhruf Waqar:</b> A fierce, high-profile female lawyer who stands up to her captors.</p></li><li><p><b>Jabal Ejlal Khan:</b> The calm, strategic Sardar of Zor Garh fighting for his people.</p></li><li><p><b>Bahram Khan:</b> Jabal’s aggressive brother who handles physical intimidation.</p></li><li><p><b>Syed Shadan Shah:</b> A respected TV anchor who uncovers deep truths.</p></li><li><p><b>Zabarj Shahnawaz:</b> A tech expert and inside collaborator driving the secret plot.</p><h3><b>What is the Story About?</b></h3><p>The plot revolves around five wealthy and influential elite friends who studied together in London: <b>Zalatan</b> (a young politician), <b>Zukhruf</b> (a sharp defense attorney), <b>Shadan</b> (a famous TV journalist), <b>Hassan</b> (a dedicated barrister), and <b>Zabarj</b> (a brilliant software engineer).</p><p>Their lives turn upside down when all five friends are suddenly drugged, kidnapped, and locked in a dark, freezing basement in a remote village called <b>Zor Garh</b>.</p><h4><b>The Conflict &amp; Revenge</b></h4><p>The abduction is planned by <b>Jabal Ejlal Khan</b>, the respected Sardar (tribal chieftain) of Zor Garh, along with his volatile brother, <b>Bahram Khan</b>.</p><p>Fifteen years ago, a massive corporate land scam backed by the elite parents of these five friends ruined Zor Garh, stealing the villagers' lands and livelihood. Now, the village leaders want justice and demand that these influential friends use their media and legal power to expose the truth.</p><h3><b>Betrayal and Moral Awakening</b></h3><p>Inside the dark cell, tension grows as the friends discover that one of their own—<b>Zabarj</b> (working covertly as a black-hat hacker named \"Agent\")—helped the captors setup the trap.</p><p><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></p><p>Faced with physical threats and harsh truth, the friends are forced to reflect on their families' corrupt pasts. What begins as a desperate escape attempt slowly transforms into a journey of self-reflection, legal fight, and moral redemption.<br><!--StartFragment--></p><h3><b>Read Online or Download PDF</b></h3><p><!--EndFragment--></p><p>You can read the complete <b>Baab-e-Dehar novel online</b> on our website or click the button below to <b>download the official PDF file</b> for offline reading.</p></li></ul>",
      "image": "images/85-6a5f07fe2e4fe-baab-e-dehar-novel-by-mehrulnisa-shahmeer-complete-pdf-2.webp",
