      "description": "<blockquote><p>Read this thrilling Urdu novel online or download the full PDF version for free to enjoy a fun story of childhood nikah, secret identities, and friendship.</p></blockquote><h2><b>Main Characters</b></h2><p></p><p><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></p><ul><li><p><b>Zar Noor / Noor Bano:</b><span>&nbsp;</span>A smart top-ranking student clueless about cooking, bound by a childhood nikah.</p></li><li><p><b>Arman Ahmed Khanzade (Ahmed):</b><span>&nbsp;</span>Zar Noor’s rich childhood fiancé hiding his true identity as a simple classmate.</p></li><li><p><b>Hamza Haider Ali:</b><span>&nbsp;</span>The energetic, flirtatious prankster who keeps the friend group entertained.</p></li><li><p><b>Munahil &amp; Haris:</b><span>&nbsp;</span>A close pair navigating childhood affection and love.</p></li><li><p><b>Yashfa:</b><span>&nbsp;</span>A bold girl whose initial rivalries with Haider turn into romance.</p></li></ul><h2><b>Story Summary</b></h2><p>The narrative begins with a lively group of university friends—<b>Haider</b>, <b>Taimoor</b>, <b>Riaz</b>, <b>Ashar</b>, <b>Haris</b>, and <b>Ahmed</b>—who spend their days studying, pulling pranks, and sharing fun moments.</p><p>The main conflict arises when <b>Zar Noor</b>, a top student, learns that she was bound in a childhood nikah to her father’s friend's son, <b>Arman Khanzade</b>, who recently returned from Italy. Unhappy with this arrangement, Zar Noor resists because she has secretly fallen in love with her university classmate, <b>Ahmed</b>.</p><p>The big twist reveals that \"Ahmed\" is actually <b>Arman Khanzade</b> himself. He used a fake identity at the university to get close to Zar Noor and understand her true feelings. Alongside their story, the novel weaves in sweet romantic subplots between their university friends.</p><h2><b>Read Online or Download PDF</b></h2><p><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></p><p>You can <b>read this novel online</b> on our platform or click the button below to <b>download the complete PDF version for free</b> to read offline anytime.</p>",
