      "description": "<p>Jaan e Tamanna by Alishy Khan is available to read online and download in PDF on our website. Enjoy this intense, multi-couple Urdu novel with easy online reading or offline PDF access.</p><p></p><h2><strong>Main Characters</strong></h2><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Zuriz Shah:</strong> A handsome, serious young man. He secretly works as an army officer (Major Shah).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Murha Shah:</strong> Zuriz's cousin, bold and strong-willed. She comes back from London as a doctor.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Kazim Shah:</strong> The elder son of Daryab Shah. Calm, mature, and very particular about his reputation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Aizal Shah:</strong> Haroon Shah's daughter. Spoiled, stubborn, and in love with Kazim.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ahaan Shah:</strong> Proud and status-conscious. Gets pulled into politics while hiding his feelings for a servant's daughter.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ghalalai:</strong> A simple, innocent Pathan girl who observes purdah. She faces coldness for years before finally being accepted.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Arzam Shah:</strong> A popular university student who loves getting into fights but becomes protective when he falls in love.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Zaisha:</strong> A quiet, religious university student who wears niqab and focuses on her studies.</li>\r\n</ul><h2><strong>Story Summary</strong></h2><p>This novel follows four love stories inside one big family, the Shahs.</p><p>Zuriz and Murha got married years ago, but Murha left for London to study medicine, and they've been apart for six years. When she comes back, things get complicated — there's old love, misunderstandings, and secrets about Zuriz's real job.</p><p>Kazim and Aizal are close, but Aizal is secretly in love with him. She creates a fake scandal to force a marriage between them. Kazim is furious and leaves for Australia, while Aizal is left behind, guilty and heartbroken.</p><p>Ahaan is married to Ghalalai, a servant's daughter, since childhood. He treats her badly for years because of his pride and a past betrayal by her father. But slowly, jealousy and love change his mind, and he finally accepts her.</p><p>Arzam is a fun, carefree guy who falls for Zaisha, a very religious girl. He keeps protecting her from trouble and eventually tells her his real feelings, marrying her secretly.</p><p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--EndFragment--></p><p>Along the way, there's also danger — Zuriz is doing secret spy work against corrupt people, and Ahaan gets caught up in political threats. But in the end, love wins for all four couples.</p>",
