      "series_id": null,
      "season_number": null,
      "description": "<p>Taqazay Mohabbat by Maham Mughal is a romantic village-based novel about Hayam and Professor Asim, forced into marriage by a tribal Jirga, whose bond slowly turns into deep love. Read online or download PDF.</p><h2><strong>Main Characters</strong></h2><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Hayam &amp; Asim Jahangir:</strong> Hayam is a university student, and Asim (known to her as Sir Asim Malik) is her strict psychology professor. A tribal dispute forces them into marriage, which slowly turns into real love.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Sanam &amp; Irtisam:</strong> Sanam is Hayam's best friend, and Irtisam is her cousin who has loved her since childhood. They marry early in the story and share a playful, romantic bond.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Gul Lala &amp; Imad:</strong> Gul Lala is a divorced mother to a little girl, Dua. Her younger cousin Imad loves her unconditionally, marries her, and accepts Dua as his own daughter.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Kaif &amp; Ramsha:</strong> Kaif is Asim and Imad's cousin who survives a deadly attack. He later falls in love with and marries Ramsha, a physiotherapist.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Asfahan &amp; Zoufa:</strong> Asfahan is Hayam's protective older brother, who marries Zoufa, his father's business partner's daughter, and leads a happy married life.</li>\r\n</ul><h2><strong>Story Summary</strong></h2><p>The story follows an extended family living in a village in Dera Ghazi Khan, weaving together several love stories — from childhood sweethearts to arranged unions built on protection and care.</p><p>Asim Jahangir is fighting a legal battle over land left by his late father, which his step-uncle Akbar Azam and his greedy brother Farhad are trying to steal using forged documents. Farhad, who is also Gul Lala's abusive ex-husband, keeps threatening the family out of greed and ego.</p><p>Things take a dark turn when Farhad plans an attack on Imad, but the bullet accidentally hits Kaif instead, putting him in a coma. The village Jirga wrongly blames Hayam's family and orders her to be handed over as compensation (Vani). To save her from this fate, Professor Asim steps in and marries her himself.</p><p>At first, Hayam is shaken to find her strict professor is now her husband. But Asim's patience, understanding, and gentle love slowly win her over, and she falls deeply in love with him.</p><p>In the end, Farhad is exposed for kidnapping Dua and trying to kill Asim, and gets a life sentence, while Asim reclaims his father's land. Kaif wakes up from his coma and finds love with Ramsha. The story ends on a happy note with the birth of Asim and Hayam's daughter, Muskaan.</p>",
