      "description": "<p>Tum Jo Aye Zindagi Main by Shagufta Kanwal: a fun, action-packed cousin romance between a mischievous martial-arts trained girl and a strict police officer. Read online or download PDF.</p><h2><strong>Main Characters</strong></h2><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Imthal (Zhale):</strong> The heroine, a bubbly, mischievous BBA student trained in martial arts and firearms. Behind her playful, witty exterior, she secretly does extensive charity work.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Adil Omar Shah:</strong> The hero, a strict, authoritative police SP who finds Imthal a total menace at first but secretly falls for her, even arranging their marriage.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Bazel:</strong> Imthal's twin brother and partner-in-crime for every prank and charity project.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Shahryar:</strong> Imthal and Bazel's elder brother, a successful businessman who dotes on the twins and shields them from their mother's anger.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Adeed:</strong> Imthal's other elder brother, raised in Germany, fiercely protective of her to the point of aggression.</li>\r\n</ul><h2><strong>Story Summary</strong></h2><p>Imthal and Bazel are twins who turn their household upside down with constant pranks, much to their mother's frustration, while their elder brother Shahryar acts as their protector and self-defence trainer.</p><p>Things change when the family reunites with their estranged grandfather after 25 years and moves into the ancestral haveli, where the twins clash constantly with their serious cousin Adil, a strict police officer exasperated by Imthal's antics. But beneath the chaos, the family discovers the twins secretly run an orphanage and fund charity work.</p><p>When a corrupt relative, Bahram Shah, tries to force a marriage on their cousin Aisha and later targets Imthal herself, Imthal takes matters into her own hands — kidnapping Bahram to stop the wedding and even beating him up when he comes after her. Her bravery and hidden kindness win over the family, and Adil, secretly smitten all along, asks his grandmother to arrange their marriage. The novel ends with several family weddings and Adil happily settling into life with his chaotic, lovable wife.</p><h2><strong>Read Online or Download PDF</strong></h2><p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--EndFragment--></p><p>You can read the complete Tum Jo Aye Zindagi Main novel online or download the PDF anytime from our website.</p>",
