      "season_number": null,
      "description": "<p>Read the complete Zihal E Maskeen novel online or download the PDF anytime from our website.</p><h2><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1px;\">Main Characters</strong></h2><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Zehal Khan Affandi (Pasha):</strong> A powerful 30-year-old mafia don who rules with his own moral code — stripping corrupt politicians of their wealth for the poor and fiercely protecting women.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Zumal Fahad Khanzada:</strong> An innocent 17- to 18-year-old girl forced into marriage by Pasha after witnessing a murder, who slowly falls in love with him.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Yaqoot Mirza:</strong> Pasha's trusted right-hand man, who handles major gang operations and captures Mishaim on Pasha's orders.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mishaim Qadeer Jilani (Mishi):</strong> The spoiled, modern daughter of a corrupt politician, whose life transforms completely because of Yaqoot's pure character and faith.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pamir and Barlas:</strong> Pasha's younger brothers, raised by him like a father figure.</li>\r\n</ul><h2><strong>Story Summary</strong></h2><p>Set in the misty valleys of Kashmir, the story follows Pasha, a ruthless mafia don who secretly protects the poor and vulnerable. When innocent Zumal accidentally witnesses him commit a murder, he kidnaps her and forces her into marriage at gunpoint. Though terrified at first, Zumal slowly falls for his fiercely protective, possessive love.</p><p>Meanwhile, a corrupt politician seeking revenge on Zumal leads to a counter-kidnapping of his own daughter, Mishaim, who ends up in the custody of Yaqoot, Pasha's right-hand man. Despite her wild lifestyle, Yaqoot's discipline and devotion transform her completely, and the two fall deeply in love.</p><p>The story takes a tragic turn when Zumal loses a pregnancy amid an attack, straining her bond with Zehal — until a near-fatal accident makes her realize how much she truly loves him. Meanwhile, Mishaim is nearly forced into another marriage, but Yaqoot arrives just in time to claim her as his own. The novel ends with both couples finding lasting peace and love together.</p>",
