      "season_number": null,
      "description": "<p>Read Hinave online on our platform or click the button below to download the complete PDF version for free to read offline anytime.</p><h2>Main Characters</h2><ul><li><p><b>Hinave Rana:</b> A strong-willed, bold, and revenge-driven girl seeking justice for her loved ones.</p></li><li><p><b>Aman Malik:</b> A powerful, arrogant, and obsessive elite model who is madly in love with Hinave despite her extreme hatred for him.</p></li><li><p><b>Khizar Hayat Rana:</b> An honest, strict, and caring SP of police who supports Hinave and serves as her protector and fiancé.</p></li><li><p><b>Shahvez Rana:</b> A traditional, rigid, and serious political figure in the Rana family.</p></li><li><p><b>Minal:</b> A soft-spoken, sensitive girl who is secretly in love with her brother-in-law, Shahvez.</p></li><li><p><b>Arham Malik:</b> A kind-hearted, gentle soul who is Aman Malik's cousin and deeply loves Nimnal.</p></li><li><p><b>Khan:</b> Aman Malik's fiercely loyal personal servant and bodyguard.</p></li></ul><h2>Story Summary</h2><p>The plot revolves around a bitter, multi-generational political feud between two powerful families: the Ranas and the Maliks:</p><ul><li><p><b>Hinave &amp; Aman:</b> Aman Malik's unchecked power and past actions cause the suicide of Hinave's close friend and leave her brother in a coma. Driven by trauma and hatred, Hinave studies law in America and returns to Pakistan to legally ruin him. However, Aman becomes pathologically obsessed with her, sparking an intense battle between her desire for justice and his dangerous obsession.</p></li><li><p><b>Khizar's Stand:</b> As a dedicated SP of police, Khizar Hayat Rana relentlessly works to legally corner Aman Malik while protecting his fiancée Hinave from the Malik family's corrupt influence.</p></li><li><p><b>Shahvez &amp; Minal:</b> Alongside the main legal warfare, a parallel subplot follows the cold, unresolved family dynamics and hidden emotions between Shahvez and Minal after their sudden marriage.</p></li></ul><p><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></p><p>Through courtroom drama, intense obsession, and deep-rooted family feuds, the narrative unfolds as a dark tale of a courageous woman fighting systemic corruption and refusing to surrender to her oppressor.</p>",
