      "description": "<h2><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--></h2><p><span>Read the complete Tujh Pe Dil Hara novel online on our website or download the PDF to enjoy this beautiful Urdu novel anytime, anywhere.</span></p><h2>Main Characters</h2><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Mir Baalaj Shah:</strong> An arrogant, short-tempered, and successful 36-year-old business tycoon.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Zarisha Siddiqui:</strong> A deeply innocent, devout, and patient 17-year-old girl.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Mir Sarwar Shah:</strong> Baalaj's younger brother, who works as an ASP.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Hayat Somro:</strong> A fearless and hardworking girl who becomes Sarwar's love and later his wife.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Aahal Somro:</strong> Hayat's brother, a university professor who falls in love with Miniha.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Miniha Faruqui:</strong> Aahal's student, who endures great hardship due to her circumstances.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Major Zouhan Yousaf Khanzada:</strong> Baalaj's childhood friend and an army officer.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Auroosh (Areesha):</strong> Zouhan's love interest and later his wife, who turns out to be Baalaj and Sarwar's long-lost sister.</li>\r\n</ul><h2>Story Summary</h2><p>Tujh Pe Dil Hara weaves together several love stories bound by fate, faith, and family secrets. At its heart is Mir Baalaj Shah, a hot-tempered billionaire who agrees to a simple Nikah with the much younger Zarisha purely for his mother's sake, remaining cold and distant at first. But Zarisha's deep faith, patience, and pure innocence slowly soften his heart, turning his indifference into fierce love and possessiveness.</p><p>Alongside their story runs the romance of Baalaj's brother, ASP Sarwar, and Hayat Somro, a strong woman haunted by her criminal father's past — a mistrust of men that Sarwar patiently overcomes by becoming her true protector. Meanwhile, Professor Aahal and his student Miniha endure a forced marriage plot by a villain before finding peace in a blessed union of their own.</p><p>The story darkens when Baalaj's estranged criminal father conspires against the family, leading to Major Zouhan's shooting and Zarisha's kidnapping. Zarisha leaps into a gorge to protect her honor and loses her memory, while Baalaj clings to unwavering faith that they'll reunite. Through careful police and military effort, the villains are finally defeated. Baalaj and Zarisha reunite in London, her memories return, and the family discovers that Zouhan's beloved Areesha is in fact their long-lost sister — bringing the story to a joyful, blessing-filled close.</p>",
