      "title": "Privacy Policy",
      "slug": "privacy-policy",
      "content": "<p><em>Last Updated: 13/07/2026</em></p><p>Kitab Nagri (\"we,\" \"our,\" \"us\") runs kitabnagri.com.pk, a free online library for reading and downloading Urdu novels. We also offer select titles as hard copies, payable through Cash on Delivery (COD). This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and how we keep it safe.</p><p>By using kitabnagri.com.pk, you agree to the practices described below.</p><h3>1. What Information We Collect</h3><p><strong>Information you give us directly:</strong></p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>For hard copy orders (COD):</strong> Your name, phone number, and delivery address — needed to ship your order and collect payment upon delivery.</li>\r\n<li><strong>For contact form or writer submissions:</strong> Your name, email, and any message or novel details you choose to share.</li>\r\n</ul><p><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong></p><ul>\r\n<li>IP address, browser type, and device details</li>\r\n<li>Pages viewed, time spent on site, and how you arrived at our site</li>\r\n<li>Cookies and similar tracking tools (explained in Section 4)</li>\r\n</ul><p>No sign-up or personal details are needed to read novels online or download free PDFs.</p><h3>2. How We Use This Information</h3><ul>\r\n<li>To process and deliver hard copy orders</li>\r\n<li>To communicate about your order, query, or novel submission</li>\r\n<li>To improve our website and reading experience</li>\r\n<li>To handle copyright requests and support queries</li>\r\n<li>To understand site traffic and usage patterns</li>\r\n<li>To detect and prevent fraud or misuse</li>\r\n</ul><h3>3. Who We Share Information With</h3><p>We never sell your personal data. We may share limited details with:</p><ul>\r\n<li><strong>Delivery partners</strong> — to ship your order and collect COD payment</li>\r\n<li><strong>Hosting and analytics providers</strong> — who help keep our site running</li>\r\n<li><strong>Legal authorities</strong> — only when required by law or to protect our legal rights</li>\r\n</ul><h3>4. Our Use of Cookies</h3><p>Cookies help us:</p><ul>\r\n<li>Remember your site preferences</li>\r\n<li>Understand visitor behavior</li>\r\n<li>Improve overall site speed and performance</li>\r\n</ul><p>You can turn off cookies in your browser settings, though this may affect how some features work.</p><h3>5. Payment Handling</h3><p>All hard copy orders are paid via <strong>Cash on Delivery</strong> only. We never collect or store card or online payment details — payment happens directly with our delivery partner.</p><h3>6. How We Protect Your Data</h3><p>We apply reasonable security measures to guard your information against loss, misuse, or unauthorized access. That said, no system online is completely risk-free, and we cannot promise absolute security.</p><h3>7. Your Rights Over Your Data</h3><p>You can:</p><ul>\r\n<li>Ask what personal data we hold about you</li>\r\n<li>Request corrections or deletion of that data</li>\r\n<li>Opt out of promotional communication</li>\r\n<li>Ask us questions about how your data is handled</li>\r\n</ul><p>To use any of these rights, reach out via our <a href=\"https://kitabnagri.com.pk/contact/\">Contact Us</a> page.</p><h3>8. Our Core Service Stays Free and Open</h3><p>Reading novels or downloading PDFs on Kitab Nagri needs no registration and involves no personal data collection. This free service remains our main offering — hard copy sales are simply an optional extra for select titles.</p><h3>9. Links to Other Websites</h3><p>Our site may link to external platforms like social media. We're not responsible for how those third-party sites handle your data or privacy.</p><h3>10. Privacy of Minors</h3><p>Kitab Nagri is not intended for children under 13, and we do not knowingly gather personal information from them.</p><h3>11. Copyright and Content Removal Requests</h3><p>Authors, publishers, or rights holders with concerns about content on our site can reach us via the <a href=\"https://kitabnagri.com.pk/contact/\">Contact Us</a> page. We handle such requests promptly.</p><h3>12. Updates to This Policy</h3><p>This policy may be revised occasionally. Any changes will appear on this page along with a new \"Last Updated\" date.</p><h3>13. Questions?</h3><p>For anything related to this policy, contact us through our <a href=\"https://kitabnagri.com.pk/contact/\">Contact Us</a> page.</p><p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--EndFragment--></p><p><strong>Kitab Nagri — Read More, Own More.</strong></p>",
