      "title": "Terms & Conditions",
      "slug": "terms-conditions",
      "content": "<p><em>Last Updated: 13/07/2026</em></p><p>Welcome to Kitab Nagri (kitabnagri.com.pk). By accessing or using our website, you agree to follow the Terms &amp; Conditions below. Please go through them carefully before using our services.</p><h3>1. What We Offer</h3><p>Kitab Nagri is mainly an online platform for Urdu novel readers. Through our site, we provide:</p><ul>\r\n<li>Free online reading of Urdu novels</li>\r\n<li>Free PDF downloads of our novel collection</li>\r\n<li>Hard copies of select titles, purchasable via Cash on Delivery (COD)</li>\r\n</ul><h3>2. Rules for Using Our Website</h3><p>When you use kitabnagri.com.pk, you agree to:</p><ul>\r\n<li>Use the site strictly for personal, non-commercial reading</li>\r\n<li>Avoid copying, redistributing, or reselling any content without our permission</li>\r\n<li>Avoid using bots, scrapers, or any automated tools to pull content from our site</li>\r\n<li>Avoid misusing the contact form or submitting false information</li>\r\n</ul><p>We reserve the right to limit or block access for anyone found violating these rules.</p><h3>3. Free Reading and Download Access</h3><ul>\r\n<li>Reading novels or downloading PDFs is free and does not require any sign-up.</li>\r\n<li>All content is meant strictly for personal reading, not commercial use.</li>\r\n<li>We work to keep links functional and content updated, but we cannot guarantee uninterrupted access at all times.</li>\r\n</ul><h3>4. Ordering Hard Copies</h3><ul>\r\n<li>A limited selection of novels is available for purchase as physical copies.</li>\r\n<li>Payment for all hard copy orders is accepted only via Cash on Delivery (COD).</li>\r\n<li>Delivery timelines may vary based on your location and courier availability.</li>\r\n<li>Once your order has been dispatched, cancellation may no longer be possible.</li>\r\n<li>We are not responsible for delivery delays caused by courier partners that are outside our control.</li>\r\n</ul><h3>5. Copyright and Ownership of Content</h3><ul>\r\n<li>Every novel on Kitab Nagri remains the property of its original author or publisher.</li>\r\n<li>We do not claim any ownership over the creative work of the novels hosted on our platform.</li>\r\n<li>If you're an author or publisher and believe your work has been used without proper authorization, reach out via our <a href=\"https://kitabnagri.com.pk/contact/\">Contact Us</a> page. We take these matters seriously and respond quickly.</li>\r\n</ul><h3>6. Submitting Your Own Novel</h3><ul>\r\n<li>Writers are welcome to submit their novels for consideration through our contact form.</li>\r\n<li>Submission does not guarantee that your work will be published on our platform.</li>\r\n<li>By submitting, you confirm that the content is entirely your own and that you hold the rights to share it.</li>\r\n</ul><h3>7. Limits on Our Liability</h3><ul>\r\n<li>Kitab Nagri is offered on an \"as is\" basis, without guarantees of uninterrupted, error-free, or fully secure access.</li>\r\n<li>We are not liable for any losses or damages resulting from your use of, or inability to use, our website or services.</li>\r\n</ul><h3>8. External Website Links</h3><p>Our site may include links to third-party platforms such as social media pages or courier tracking tools. We hold no responsibility for the content or privacy practices of these outside websites.</p><h3>9. Updates to These Terms</h3><p>These Terms &amp; Conditions may be revised periodically. If you continue using our website after any changes are made, it means you accept the updated terms.</p><h3>10. Legal Jurisdiction</h3><p>These Terms &amp; Conditions are governed by the laws of Pakistan.</p><h3>11. Questions or Concerns?</h3><p>For any questions related to these Terms &amp; Conditions, please get in touch through our <a href=\"https://kitabnagri.com.pk/contact/\">Contact Us</a> page.</p><p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--EndFragment--></p><p><strong>Kitab Nagri — Read More, Own More.</strong></p>",
