    {
      "_id": {
        "$numberInt": "3"
      },
      "title": "Disclaimer",
      "slug": "disclaimer",
      "content": "<p><em>Last Updated: 13/07/2026</em></p><p>The content available on Kitab Nagri (kitabnagri.com.pk) is meant purely for general reading and entertainment. By using our website, you accept the terms outlined in this disclaimer.</p><h3>1. Who Owns the Content</h3><p>Every novel, story, and piece of related content on Kitab Nagri belongs to its original author or publisher. We do not claim ownership or authorship of any book featured on our platform. Our role is simply to provide access for personal reading purposes.</p><h3>2. Reporting Copyright Concerns</h3><p>If you are an author, publisher, or rights holder and feel that your work has been posted on our site without proper authorization, please reach out via our <a href=\"https://kitabnagri.com.pk/contact/\">Contact Us</a> page with the relevant details. We treat copyright concerns seriously and act on genuine requests without delay.</p><h3>3. Accuracy of Content</h3><p>We make an effort to keep our novel library, descriptions, and general site content correct and up to date. That said, we cannot guarantee that every detail — including novel information, author names, or availability — is always complete or error-free.</p><h3>4. Not a Source of Professional Advice</h3><p>Everything on Kitab Nagri is intended for entertainment and reading purposes only. Nothing on our platform should be treated as legal, professional, or expert advice.</p><h3>5. Links to Other Websites</h3><p>Our site may contain links to external platforms or services. We have no control over these third-party sites and are not responsible for their content, accuracy, or privacy practices.</p><h3>6. Website Availability</h3><p>We work to keep Kitab Nagri running smoothly and accessible, but uninterrupted service is not guaranteed. Occasional downtime may occur due to maintenance, technical issues, or factors outside our control.</p><h3>7. Hard Copy Order Details</h3><p>Information regarding hard copy novel orders — including pricing, delivery, and Cash on Delivery terms — is shared in good faith. Actual delivery timelines may shift due to courier-related factors beyond our control.</p><h3>8. Limits on Our Responsibility</h3><p>Kitab Nagri, along with its team and affiliates, is not liable for any loss, damage, or inconvenience that may result from using this website or relying on the information provided here.</p><h3>9. Updates to This Disclaimer</h3><p>This Disclaimer may be updated periodically without advance notice. Continuing to use our website means you accept the most current version.</p><h3>10. Get in Touch</h3><p>For any questions about this Disclaimer, please contact us via our <a href=\"https://kitabnagri.com.pk/contact/\">Contact Us</a> page.</p><p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--EndFragment--></p><p><strong>Kitab Nagri — Read More, Own More.</strong></p>",
      "meta_title": "",
      "meta_description": "",
      "status": "publish",
      "created_at": {
