    {
      "_id": {
        "$numberInt": "4"
      },
      "title": "Return & Refund Policy",
      "slug": "return-refund-policy",
      "content": "<p><em>Last Updated: 13/07/2026</em></p><p>At Kitab Nagri, your satisfaction matters to us. This policy explains the rules and process for returning hard copy novels ordered from kitabnagri.com.pk and getting a refund.</p><h3>1. Return Eligibility Period</h3><p>You may request a return within <strong>7 days</strong> of receiving your order. Requests submitted after this period will not be entertained, so please check your order as soon as it arrives.</p><h3>2. Conditions Your Return Must Meet</h3><p>For a return to be accepted, the novel must be:</p><ul>\r\n<li>In unused, original condition</li>\r\n<li>Free of any damage, stains, or writing</li>\r\n<li>Packed in its original packaging (where applicable)</li>\r\n</ul><p>Books that appear used, marked, or damaged due to mishandling by the customer will not qualify for a return or refund.</p><h3>3. Steps to Start a Return</h3><p>To begin a return, reach out to us via our <a href=\"https://kitabnagri.com.pk/contact/\">Contact Us</a> page within the 7-day window. Please mention your order number and the reason for return. Our support team will respond with the next steps.</p><h3>4. Who Pays for Return Shipping</h3><ul>\r\n<li>The customer is responsible for covering return shipping costs.</li>\r\n<li>Kitab Nagri does not cover the courier charges for sending the item back.</li>\r\n<li>Please use a trustworthy courier and hold on to your receipt until the return is confirmed on our end.</li>\r\n</ul><h3>5. Refund Process</h3><ul>\r\n<li>After we receive and check the returned book, we'll inform you whether the refund is approved or declined.</li>\r\n<li>Approved refunds are processed within <strong>5–7 business days</strong>.</li>\r\n<li>Since orders are placed via Cash on Delivery, refunds will be sent through <strong>JazzCash, EasyPaisa, or direct bank transfer</strong>, based on what's convenient for you.</li>\r\n<li>Delivery charges paid at the time of order are not refundable.</li>\r\n</ul><h3>6. Wrong or Damaged Deliveries</h3><p>If your order arrives damaged, defective, or is not what you ordered, contact us within 7 days of delivery and attach photos of the item. In these cases, we will arrange either a replacement or a full refund, and return shipping may be covered by us.</p><h3>7. What Cannot Be Returned</h3><ul>\r\n<li>Free PDF downloads and online reading content, since these are offered at no cost.</li>\r\n<li>Any book that was clearly labeled as non-returnable at checkout.</li>\r\n</ul><h3>8. Need Help?</h3><p>For any queries related to returns or refunds, visit our <a href=\"https://kitabnagri.com.pk/contact/\">Contact Us</a> page and our team will assist you.</p><p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--EndFragment--></p><p><strong>Kitab Nagri — Read More, Own More.</strong></p>",
